#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/quick-reference.rst:111
msgid ""
"``\"http\": {\"surface\": \"off\"}`` gives a load balancer with no "
"firewall. TCP and UDP frontends never use the firewall."
msgstr ""
"``\"http\": {\"surface\": \"off\"}`` बिना फ़ायरवॉल वाला लोड बैलेंसर देता "
"है। TCP और UDP फ़्रंटएंड कभी फ़ायरवॉल का इस्तेमाल नहीं करते।"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/quick-reference.rst:113
msgid ""
"The operator console of the edge (SID 0031) needs a ``console`` section "
"in the file:"
msgstr "एज के ऑपरेटर कंसोल (SID 0031) के लिए फ़ाइल में ``console`` सेक्शन चाहिए:"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/quick-reference.rst:115
msgid ""
"# console: { listen: \"127.0.0.1:9443\", data_dir: \"/var/lib/sibuna\", "
"node: 1 }\n"
"sibuna init-admin admin --data-dir /var/lib/sibuna    # once, while the "
"daemon is stopped\n"
"sibuna --config-file edge.jlv                         # then open "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/ and the page Edge\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge          # the "
"node, its frontends and its pools\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge/fleet    # one "
"row for each member\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" -H \"X-Console-CSRF: $CSRF\" -H \"Origin: "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n"
"     -d '{\"line\":\"set server app/a state drain\"}' "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge/command"
msgstr ""
"# console: { listen: \"127.0.0.1:9443\", data_dir: \"/var/lib/sibuna\", node: 1 }\n"
"sibuna init-admin admin --data-dir /var/lib/sibuna    # एक बार, जब डेमन बंद हो\n"
"sibuna --config-file edge.jlv                         # फिर http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/ और Edge पेज खोलें\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge          # नोड, उसके फ़्रंटएंड और उसके पूल\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge/fleet    # हर मेंबर के लिए एक रो\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" -H \"X-Console-CSRF: $CSRF\" -H \"Origin: http://127.0.0.1:9443\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n"
"     -d '{\"line\":\"set server app/a state drain\"}' http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge/command"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/quick-reference.rst:125
msgid ""
"The command route takes ``set server ... state|weight``, ``add server``, "
"``del server``, ``del ban``, ``reload cluster`` and ``show "
"servers|cluster|certs|ca``, each with the checks of ``sibuna ctl``. It "
"needs the role of an operator."
msgstr ""
"कमांड रूट ``set server ... state|weight``, ``add server``, ``del "
"server``, ``del ban``, ``reload cluster`` और ``show "
"servers|cluster|certs|ca`` लेता है, हर एक ``sibuna ctl`` के चेक्स के साथ। "
"इसके लिए ऑपरेटर रोल चाहिए।"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/quick-reference.rst:127
msgid ""
"Admission options of a frontend (SID 0032): ``\"defer_accept\": \"5s\"`` "
"and ``\"backlog\": 4096`` on ``tcp`` and ``http``; ``\"inspect_bytes\"`` "
"and ``\"inspect_fallback\": {\"absent\": {\"action\": \"deny\"}}`` beside "
"``tcp_inspect``; ``\"udp_inspect\": \"quic\"`` on ``udp``. All are off by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"फ़्रंटएंड के एडमिशन ऑप्शन (SID 0032): ``tcp`` और ``http`` पर "
"``\"defer_accept\": \"5s\"`` और ``\"backlog\": 4096``; ``tcp_inspect`` के "
"साथ ``\"inspect_bytes\"`` और ``\"inspect_fallback\": {\"absent\": "
"{\"action\": \"deny\"}}``; ``udp`` पर ``\"udp_inspect\": \"quic\"``। सभी "
"डिफ़ॉल्ट रूप से बंद हैं।"

#: ../../../../../../home/insan/projects/sibuna/docs/book/quick-reference.rst:129
msgid ""
"Admission under attack (SID 0034): ``\"max_flows_per_ip\": 20`` and "
"``\"max_flows\": 5000`` on any frontend; ``\"refuse\": \"reset\"`` (the "
"default), ``\"close\"`` or ``\"tarpit\"`` and ``\"auto_ban\": "
"{\"strikes\": 50, \"window\": \"10s\", \"ban\": \"10m\"}`` on ``tcp`` and "
"``http``; ``\"total_pps\"`` in ``udp_defense``; ``\"pressure\": {\"on\": "
"90, \"off\": 75, \"new_per_second\": 1000}`` (on by default, ``\"off\"`` "
"switches it off) and ``\"accept_threads\": \"auto\"`` in ``global``."
msgstr ""
"हमले के समय एडमिशन (SID 0034): किसी भी फ़्रंटएंड पर "
"``\"max_flows_per_ip\": 20`` और ``\"max_flows\": 5000``; ``tcp`` और "
"``http`` पर ``\"refuse\": \"reset\"`` (डिफ़ॉल्ट), ``\"close\"`` या "
"``\"tarpit\"`` और ``\"auto_ban\": {\"strikes\": 50, \"window\": \"10s\", "
"\"ban\": \"10m\"}``; ``udp_defense`` में ``\"total_pps\"``; ``global`` "
"में ``\"pressure\": {\"on\": 90, \"off\": 75, \"new_per_second\": 1000}`` "
"(डिफ़ॉल्ट रूप से चालू, ``\"off\"`` इसे बंद करता है) और "
"``\"accept_threads\": \"auto\"``।"

